-m\">但是；然而；虽然</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"198643\">ねえ、<ruby>元気<rp>(</rp><rt>げんき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がないみたいだけど。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">天啊,你看着绿 周围的刺。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">打撃</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だげき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">打击；冲击；撞击；损害；击球；打击</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"207950\">その<ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らせは<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にとって<ruby>打撃<rp>(</rp><rt>だげき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">新闻对他来说是个打击</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">駄作</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ださく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">劣作；拙作；垃圾作品</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">出す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">取出；拿出；放出；露出；显示；提交；交出；出版；公开；寄送；发送；发出（声音）；点燃（火）；上（菜）；供应（食物）；…出去；…出来；开始…；突然…</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"224634\">ここではおいしい<ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べ<ruby>物<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们在这里提供很好的食品。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"